    <main id="main-doc">

      <section class="main-section" id="Nail_Prep">
        <header>Nail Prep</header>
        <p>Clean the nails with <code>isopropyl alcohol</code> to remove oils and dust.</p>
        <p>Use a <code>nail buffer</code> to lightly roughen the surface for better adhesion.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Wash hands thoroughly.</li>
          <li>Push back cuticles gently.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="main-section" id="Gel_Base">
        <header>Gel Base</header>
        <p>Apply a thin, even layer of <code>base coat</code> to each nail.</p>
        <p>Cure under a <code>UV</code> or <code>LED</code> lamp for 60 seconds.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Avoid flooding the cuticle area.</li>
          <li>Wipe off excess product before curing.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="main-section" id="Gel_Color_Application">
        <header>Gel Color Application</header>
        <p>Use thin layers of <code>gel polish</code> for an even finish.</p>
        <p>Cure each coat before applying the next to prevent wrinkling.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Apply first color coat.</li>
          <li>Cure for 60 seconds.</li>
          <li>Repeat for second coat.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="main-section" id="Nail_Extensions">
        <header>Nail Extensions</header>
        <p>Use <code>builder gel</code> or forms to create nail extensions.</p>
        <p>Shape evenly before curing for consistent results.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Choose the correct nail form size.</li>
          <li>Apply builder gel carefully.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="main-section" id="Gel_Removal">
        <header>Gel Removal</header>
        <p>Buff off the shiny top coat to break the seal.</p>
        <p>Soak nails in <code>acetone</code> for 10–15 minutes and remove softened gel.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Wrap nails in foil and cotton soaked with acetone.</li>
          <li>Use a <code>cuticle pusher</code> to gently scrape off gel.</li>
          <li>Finish with cuticle oil for moisture.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </main>
